@startuml
title D-02 Authority Boundary Model
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 220

rectangle "Authority Domains" {
  component "Raw parking session lifecycle\nOwner: Vendor PMS / HCP" as A1
  component "Normal tariff computation\nOwner: Vendor PMS / HCP" as A2
  component "Payment-linked control state\nOwner: Central PMS" as A3
  component "Platform payment finality\nOwner: Central PMS" as A4
  component "Fiscal issuance\nOwner: Resolved Site POS Server" as A5
  component "Fiscal reference recording\nOwner: Central PMS" as A6
  component "ExitAuthorization\nOwner: Central PMS" as A7
  component "Gate execution\nOwner: Gate system consuming Central PMS auth" as A8
  component "Discount policy resolution\nOwner: Central PMS / Discount workflow" as A9
  component "Continuity governance\nOwner: approved governance workflow" as A10
  component "Reporting visibility\nOwner: Management Dashboard as consumer only" as A11
}

rectangle "Non-Authority Surfaces" {
  component "WebPay\ncustomer payment surface" as WebPay
  component "Payment Orchestrator\nverified outcome reporter" as POA
  component "Assisted Payment Terminal\npayment-capable workflow surface" as APT
  component "Operator Console\ngovernance / review only" as Console
  component "Management Dashboard\nvisibility / export only" as Dash
  component "Projection Data\noperational visibility only" as Projection
}

WebPay ..> A3 : submits channel flow
POA ..> A4 : reports evidence, not finality
APT ..> A3 : submits terminal workflow
Console ..> A10 : records governance actions
Dash ..> A11 : displays labeled reports
Projection ..> A10 : may support degraded decisions

note right of POA
Provider success is evidence.
Central PMS declares platform finality.
end note

note bottom of Projection
Projection is not tariff truth, payment finality,
fiscal truth, financial truth, discount approval,
or exit authority.
end note

note bottom of A5
Fiscal issuance must succeed before normal
ExitAuthorization unless approved exception policy applies.
end note
@enduml
